 "headline": "\"Equally exclusive and accessible for horror newbies and diehards alike. Here's hoping this is only the beginning of the Overnightmare.\"  —Collider",
 "intro": "Peacock and Blumhouse invited guests to face their fears with AN overnightmare experience AT THE LEGENDARY STANLEY HOTEL.",
