  {
   "title": "SCARE EXPERIENCES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We designed four distinct scare experiences themed around key Blumhouse films <strong><em>Insidious</em></strong>, <strong><em>The Purge</em></strong>, <strong><em>Freaky</em></strong> and <strong><em>Happy Death Day</em></strong>; showcasing the lore and giving power to our guests to dictate the level of horror they would experience during their stay. </p>",
     "right": "<p>‍</p>"
